id: pm-gh1465
title: "GH-1465: Represent implementer-to-verifier handoff as project context"
description: Assess reported lifecycle ambiguity when completed implementation is released for verification; distinguish a customizable project review queue from active work and preserve handoff evidence.
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-14T07:54:40.366Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-15T06:10:27.431Z"
